    "This is the measured four-source compilation sample, not average arbitrary-application compiler throughput.",
    "Each phase divides by its campaign's fresh TypeScript measurements; cross-phase changes include measurement variability. The latest P45 vs P44 same-run average regression is9.387%, not the1.55% difference between separately measured published P44 andP45 points.",
