    "P43 local pair and the other3sources were timed in separate campaigns under the same protocol.",
    "Earlier P8–24 ordinary check-and-trust measurements concern a single compiler source without emission; do not connect them to this average.",
    "Earlier P35–36 four-source measurements used pair,Mandelbrot,symbolic regression,ray;P39–42 core measurements used pair,tree,numeric,list. Neither cohort is this latest4source series.",
    "Host import has asymmetric cost: Bend loads its large API lazily inside the request, while TypeScript loads compiler modules in the separately timed import. Import-plus-request is a separate useful metric and must not silently replace request timing.",
    "Only three samples per role; small differences do not establish significance."
